<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P raises Omron CP rating to A1 from A2.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P raises Omron CP rating to A1 from A2.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had raised Omron Corp's commercial paper rating to A1 from A2.  </p>
<p>The upgrade reflects a significant improvement in the company's capital structure in line with material debt reduction over the past few years, the rating agency said in a statement.</p>
<p>Omron, which makes control components and systems, had restored its balance sheet to the strong level it enjoyed in the late 1980s, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
